<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<title>Jurnal Mengajar</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jspdf/2.5.1/jspdf.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jspdf-autotable/3.8.2/jspdf.plugin.autotable.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2/dist/umd/supabase.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #f5f5f3;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --ink: #1c1c1e;
    --ink-soft: #71717a;
    --ink-faint: #a8a8ad;
    --line: #e7e7e4;
    --accent: #3f6259;
    --accent-soft: #dce8e2;
    --accent-tint: #eef3f1;
    --danger: #b3523f;
    --danger-soft: #f3e0da;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .app{
    max-width:460px;
    margin:0 auto;
    min-height:100vh;
    padding: 0 0 40px;
  }
  header{ padding: 32px 22px 20px; }
  header .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  header h1{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:26px;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
    margin:0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  header p{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin:8px 0 0;
  }
  .stats{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:18px; }
  .stat{
    flex:1;
    background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:12px 14px;
  }
  .stat .num{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:20px;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .stat .lbl{ font-size:11px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top:4px; }

  nav.tabs{
    display:flex;
    margin: 4px 22px 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:4px;
    position:sticky;
    top:12px;
    z-index:5;
  }
  nav.tabs button{
    flex:1;
    padding:9px 6px;
    border-radius:7px;
    border:none;
    background:transparent;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:12.5px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  nav.tabs button.active{ background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }

  main{ padding: 0 22px; }
  .view{ display:none; }
  .view.active{ display:block; }

  .card{
    background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:20px;
  }
  .card + .card{ margin-top:16px; }
  .card h3{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin:0 0 4px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .card .hint{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin:0 0 16px;
    line-height:1.5;
  }

  .banner{
    display:none;
    background: var(--accent);
    color:#fff;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 18px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .banner.show{ display:block; }
  .banner .lbl{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    opacity:.75;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .banner .name{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:24px;
    line-height:1.2;
  }

  .field{ margin-bottom:16px; }
  .field:last-of-type{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .field label{
    display:block;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .field input, .field textarea, .field select{
    width:100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:9px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 11px 12px;
    outline:none;
    transition: border-color .15s;
  }
  .field select{ appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='10' height='6'><path d='M0 0l5 6 5-6z' fill='%2371717a'/></svg>"); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right 14px center; }
  .field input:focus, .field textarea:focus, .field select:focus{
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .field textarea{ resize:vertical; min-height:64px; line-height:1.5; }
  .field .empty-hint{
    font-size:11.5px;
    color: var(--danger);
    margin-top:6px;
  }

  .check-inline{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .check-inline input{ width:18px; height:18px; accent-color: var(--accent); cursor:pointer; }
  .row3{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:12px; }
  .row3 .field{ flex:1; margin-bottom:0; }
  .row3 input{ text-align:center; }

  .status-btns{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:10px; }
  .status-btn{
    flex:1;
    padding:10px 6px;
    border-radius:9px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:12.5px;
    cursor:pointer;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .status-btn.sakit{ border-color:#d9a441; color:#8a6a1f; }
  .status-btn.ijin{ border-color:#5b7fa6; color:#3d5a78; }
  .status-btn.alpa{ border-color: var(--danger); color: var(--danger); }
  .status-btn:active{ opacity:.8; }

  input[type="file"]{
    width:100%;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding:8px 0;
  }

  .btn-primary{
    width:100%;
    padding:14px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:10px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:15px;
    cursor:pointer;
    margin-top:18px;
  }
  .btn-primary:active{ opacity:.85; }
  .btn-ghost{
    width:100%;
    padding:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:13.5px;
    cursor:pointer;
    margin-top:10px;
  }

  .add-row{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .add-row input{
    flex:1;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:9px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    outline:none;
  }
  .add-row input:focus{ border-color: var(--accent); background:#fff; }
  .add-row button{
    padding: 0 16px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:9px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:13.5px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .chip-list{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .chip-list li{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    background: var(--bg);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:9px;
    padding:10px 12px;
    font-size:14px;
  }
  .chip-list button{
    border:none;
    background:none;
    color: var(--danger);
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:2px 6px;
  }
  .chip-list .empty-row{
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size:13px;
    padding:8px 2px;
  }

  .search{ margin-bottom:16px; }
  .search input{
    width:100%;
    padding:11px 14px;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    outline:none;
  }
  .search input:focus{ border-color: var(--accent); }

  .empty{ text-align:center; padding:60px 10px; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .empty .mark{
    display:block;
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:16px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }

  .entry{
    background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:16px 16px 14px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .entry .top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .entry .date{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-tint);
    padding:3px 8px;
    border-radius:6px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .entry h3{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-size:15.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .entry .sub{ font-size:12px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:10px; }
  .entry .kv{ margin-bottom:10px; }
  .entry .kv .k{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom:2px;
  }
  .entry .kv .v{
    font-size:13.5px;
    line-height:1.5;
    color:#3f3f42;
    white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .entry .actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:10px;
    margin-top:4px;
  }
  .entry .actions button{
    border:none;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius:7px;
    padding:6px 12px;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:600;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .entry .actions .edit{ color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .entry .actions .del{ color: var(--danger); }

  .toast{
    position:fixed;
    bottom:24px;
    left:50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    padding:10px 18px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-size:13px;
    opacity:0;
    transition: all .25s ease;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:50;
    max-width:90%;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .toast.show{ opacity:1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  .footer-note{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:11px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-top:24px;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <div id="configWarning" style="display:none; background:#b3523f; color:#fff; padding:12px 18px; font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.5; text-align:center;">
    ⚠️ Supabase belum dikonfigurasi. Buka kode sumber (index.html), cari <code>SUPABASE_URL</code> dan <code>SUPABASE_ANON_KEY</code> di bagian atas &lt;script&gt;, lalu isi dengan data project Supabase Anda.
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== LAYAR LOGIN ===================== -->
  <div id="loginScreen">
    <header>
      <div class="eyebrow">Buku Catatan Digital</div>
      <h1>Jurnal Mengajar</h1>
      <p>Masuk memakai NIP untuk mulai mencatat jurnal</p>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div id="loginGuruBox">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Masuk sebagai Guru</h3>
          <p class="hint">Masukkan NIP Anda yang sudah terdaftar.</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label>NIP</label>
            <input type="text" id="loginNip" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Masukkan NIP Anda">
          </div>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="loginAsGuru()">Masuk</button>
          <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="showRegisterBox()">Belum terdaftar? Daftar sebagai guru baru</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="registerGuruBox" style="display:none;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Daftar Guru Baru</h3>
          <p class="hint">Isi data Anda sekali saja. Setelah terdaftar, cukup masuk memakai NIP.</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Nama Guru</label>
            <input type="text" id="regNama" placeholder="Nama lengkap">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Mata Pelajaran yang Diampu</label>
            <input type="text" id="regMapel" placeholder="mis. IPA">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>NIP</label>
            <input type="text" id="regNip" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Nomor Induk Pegawai">
          </div>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="registerGuru()">Daftar & Masuk</button>
          <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="showLoginBox()">Sudah terdaftar? Kembali ke Masuk</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="loginAdminBox" style="display:none; margin-top:16px;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Masuk sebagai Admin</h3>
          <div class="field">
            <label>PIN Admin</label>
            <input type="password" id="loginAdminPin" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="PIN Admin">
          </div>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="loginAsAdmin()">Masuk sebagai Admin</button>
          <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="hideAdminBox()">Batal</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:22px;">
        <button id="adminToggleBtn" onclick="showAdminBox()" style="border:none; background:none; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:12px; text-decoration:underline; cursor:pointer;">Admin</button>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== LAYAR APLIKASI ===================== -->
  <div id="appScreen" style="display:none;">
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">Buku Catatan Digital</div>
    <h1>Jurnal Mengajar</h1>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" id="statTotal">0</div><div class="lbl">Total catatan</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" id="statWeek">0</div><div class="lbl">Minggu ini</div></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:14px;">
      <span id="sessionLabel" style="font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:.85;"></span>
      <button onclick="logout()" style="margin-left:8px; border:none; background:none; color:var(--accent); font-size:12px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; cursor:pointer;">Keluar</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="tabs">
    <button id="tabWrite" class="active" onclick="switchView('write')">Tulis</button>
    <button id="tabHist" onclick="switchView('hist')">Riwayat</button>
    <button id="tabSettings" onclick="switchView('settings')" style="display:none;">Pengaturan</button>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section id="viewWrite" class="view active">
      <div class="banner" id="guruBanner">
        <div class="lbl">Mengisi jurnal sebagai</div>
        <div class="name" id="guruBannerName">—</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Nama Guru</label>
          <select id="fGuru" onchange="onGuruChange()"></select>
          <div class="empty-hint" id="guruEmptyHint" style="display:none;">Belum ada data guru. Tambahkan dulu di menu Pengaturan.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Tanggal</label>
          <input type="date" id="fTanggal">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Kelas</label>
          <select id="fKelas"></select>
          <div class="empty-hint" id="kelasEmptyHint" style="display:none;">Belum ada data kelas. Tambahkan dulu di menu Pengaturan.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Jam Ke</label>
          <select id="fJam"></select>
          <div class="empty-hint" id="jamEmptyHint" style="display:none;">Belum ada data jam mengajar. Tambahkan dulu di menu Pengaturan.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Materi</label>
          <input type="text" id="fMateri" placeholder="mis. Sistem Pencernaan">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>1. Tuliskan pengalaman/hal-hal baik selama pembelajaran</label>
          <textarea id="fRefleksi1" placeholder="Pengalaman atau hal baik yang terjadi selama pembelajaran"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>2. Tuliskan hal-hal yang belum baik/kendala dihadapi selama pembelajaran</label>
          <textarea id="fRefleksi2" placeholder="Hal yang belum baik atau kendala selama pembelajaran"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>3. Tindak lanjut yang akan dilaksanakan untuk perbaikan pembelajaran</label>
          <textarea id="fRefleksi3" placeholder="Rencana tindak lanjut untuk perbaikan pembelajaran"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Kehadiran Siswa</label>
          <label class="check-inline">
            <input type="checkbox" id="fHadirSemua" checked onchange="toggleHadirSemua()">
            Hadir Semua
          </label>
          <div id="absenDetail" style="display:none; margin-top:14px;">
            <div class="field">
              <label>Nama Siswa</label>
              <input type="text" id="fSiswaNama" placeholder="Ketik nama siswa, lalu pilih status">
            </div>
            <div class="status-btns">
              <button type="button" class="status-btn sakit" onclick="addSiswa('Sakit')">Sakit</button>
              <button type="button" class="status-btn ijin" onclick="addSiswa('Ijin')">Ijin</button>
              <button type="button" class="status-btn alpa" onclick="addSiswa('Alpa')">Alpa</button>
            </div>
            <ul class="chip-list" id="siswaListUI" style="margin-top:12px;"></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="saveEntry()" id="saveBtn">Simpan Catatan</button>
      <button class="btn-ghost" id="cancelEditBtn" onclick="resetForm()" style="display:none;">Batalkan Ubah</button>
    </section>

    <section id="viewHist" class="view">
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
        <h3>Simpan Jurnal (PDF)</h3>
        <p class="hint">Pilih nama guru dan tanggal, lampiran jurnal ukuran A4 siap diunduh.</p>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Nama Guru</label>
          <select id="pdfGuru"></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Tanggal Jurnal</label>
          <input type="date" id="pdfTanggal">
        </div>
        <button class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:14px;" onclick="generateJournalPDF()">Buat & Unduh PDF</button>
      </div>

      <div class="search">
        <input type="text" id="searchBox" placeholder="Cari guru, kelas, mapel, atau materi..." oninput="renderEntries()">
      </div>
      <div id="entryList"></div>
      <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="exportCSV()">Unduh sebagai CSV</button>
    </section>

    <section id="viewSettings" class="view">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>PIN Admin</h3>
        <p class="hint">PIN ini dipakai untuk masuk sebagai Admin lewat tombol "Admin" di layar Masuk. Segera ganti dari PIN bawaan.</p>
        <div class="field">
          <label>PIN Admin Baru</label>
          <input type="password" id="adminPinInput" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Masukkan PIN baru">
        </div>
        <button class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:0;" onclick="saveAdminPin()">Simpan PIN Admin</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Wilayah (Kecamatan)</h3>
        <p class="hint">Dipakai pada baris tanda tangan lampiran PDF, contoh: "Negara, 18 Juli 2026".</p>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Nama Kecamatan</label>
          <input type="text" id="wilayahInput" placeholder="mis. Negara">
        </div>
        <button class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:0;" onclick="saveWilayah()">Simpan Wilayah</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Data Kepala Sekolah</h3>
        <p class="hint">Dipakai pada kolom tanda tangan "Mengetahui" di sebelah kiri lampiran PDF.</p>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Nama Kepala Sekolah</label>
          <input type="text" id="kepsekNamaInput" placeholder="Nama lengkap kepala sekolah">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>NIP Kepala Sekolah</label>
          <input type="text" id="kepsekNipInput" placeholder="Nomor Induk Pegawai">
        </div>
        <button class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:0;" onclick="saveKepsek()">Simpan Data Kepala Sekolah</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Kop Jurnal (Gambar Header)</h3>
        <p class="hint">Upload gambar memanjang berisi logo dinas, logo sekolah, dan teks kop (termasuk aksara Bali). Disarankan sekitar 2600×300 px, format PNG/JPG, di bawah 500KB. Jika belum diupload, kop PDF otomatis memakai teks biasa.</p>
        <input type="file" id="headerImageInput" accept="image/png,image/jpeg" onchange="handleHeaderImageUpload(event)">
        <div id="headerImagePreviewWrap" style="display:none; margin-top:12px;">
          <img id="headerImagePreview" style="width:100%; display:block; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px;">
